---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Not affiliated with SONDORS or any seller. Safety, liability, downloads and takedown requests, and analytics."
  editPath="src/pages/disclaimer.astro"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="draft label">
        Draft. This text is a starting point, not legal advice, and will be reviewed by a lawyer
        before launch.
      </p>

      <p>
        This site is an independent, community-maintained educational resource. It is not affiliated
        with, endorsed by, or connected to SONDORS Inc., SiAECOSYS, QS Motor, Votol, or any seller
        listed here. Everything is provided "as is," without warranty of any kind, and may be
        incomplete or wrong. The Metacycle has a 72 V high-voltage system, heavy components, and
        safety-critical brakes and suspension. Any maintenance, repair, or modification you do is at
        your own risk; if you're unsure, use a qualified technician. Modifications may affect road
        legality, registration, insurance, or warranty. Links to third-party sellers are for
        convenience only; we don't control them and aren't responsible for their products, prices,
        or conduct. Trademarks belong to their owners. To the fullest extent permitted by law, the
        maintainers and contributors are not liable for any damage, injury, or loss arising from use
        of this site.
      </p>

      <h2 id="downloads">Downloads &amp; copyright</h2>
      <p>
        The <a href="/downloads">downloads page</a> lists mirrored copies of manuals and controller
        software so they stay available if the original links disappear. Each file keeps its
        original rights; we don't claim them. Every file is listed with where it came from, the date
        it was retrieved, a SHA-256 checksum and a link to the original where one still exists. The
        files are hosted in a separate repository, not in this site.
      </p>

      <h2 id="takedown">Takedown requests</h2>
      <p>
        If you hold rights to material on this site or in its downloads and want it removed, contact
        <strong>TODO: takedown contact</strong>. Tell us which file or page, and how you hold the
        rights. We honor requests promptly. Until that address exists, you can also open an issue in
        the <a href={site.repoUrl}>site's repository</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 id="analytics">Analytics</h2>
      {site.analytics ? (
        <p>
          We count page views with <a href={site.analytics.privacyUrl}>{site.analytics.provider}</a>
          , which sets no cookies and stores no personal data. It records the page address, the
          referring site, browser, operating system and device type, and an approximate location
          (country, region, city). Your IP address is used only to make a daily visitor count and is
          not stored. There are no ads and no accounts on this site.
        </p>
      ) : (
        <p>This site doesn't use analytics.</p>
      )}

      <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>TODO:</strong> There are no affiliate links on this site today. If they're ever
        enabled, they'll apply only to tools, never to parts, and this section will say so before
        the first one goes live.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .draft {
    border-left: var(--border-accent) solid var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
  }
</style>
